OL,3,GNEWSALandline services affected after
OL,4,A1km of cable stolen
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people have had landline
OL,7,Fphone services disrupted after about
OL,8,F1km (0.62 miles) of cable was stolen in
OL,9,Fa village in Leicestershire.
OL,11,FOpenreach said the theft on Antsey Lane
OL,12,Fin Thurcaston was reported to its
OL,13,Fengineering team on 14 October.
OL,15,FAccording to the provider, about 200
OL,16,Fcustomers were impacted by the theft,
OL,17,Fwith services due to be restored "by
OL,18,Fthe end of the week, with some
OL,19,Fcustomers reconnected before then".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
